Subject: [PATCH 3/7] sapphire: add lct_audio_info driver

Longcheer /sys/android_audio/{audio_codec,audio_pa} helper, based on the
Xiaomi-published Longcheer driver and trimmed to match the stock sapphire
lct_audio_info_dlkm.ko (verified: same functions, exports, imports).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
